<title>UK: Lloyds Tsb year pretax profit up 52 pct.</title>
<headline>Lloyds Tsb year pretax profit up 52 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  31.2		 vs 19.2</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   13.2		 vs 11.0</p>
<p> Pretax			 2.505 billion    vs 1.650 billion</p>
<p> Total income		 6.749 billion    vs 6.280 billion</p>
<p> Total debt provision     327		  vs 583</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 2.41 and 2.48 billion stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Lloyds TSB Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
